This is the rtl433_interface-write-a-block package meant as a guide to building
out-of-tree packages. To use the rtl433_interface blocks, the Python namespaces
is in 'rtl433_interface', which is imported as:

    import rtl433_interface

See the Doxygen documentation for details about the blocks available
in this package. A quick listing of the details can be found in Python
after importing by using:

    help(rtl433_interface)
